<title>CANADA: Canada real return bond yields median 4.319 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada real return bond yields median 4.319 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$500 million auction of 4.25 percent real return bonds due December 1, 2026 produced the following results:</p>
<p>		     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>    Median	 4.319	   N/A</p>
<p>    Low	    4.249	   N/A</p>
<p>    Allotment    4.500	 95.940  Allotment ratio 3.73737</p>
<p>The bonds will be delivered on June 9. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$2.85 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$793.8 million, including C$25 million non-competitive tenders at the allotment yield.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100)) (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
